NOTES
  - You need to install depenedencies
    $ cargo install cbindgen

EXAMPLES
  - Building with LLVM 22.1 (with installation)
    $ ./build.sh --with-llvm=llvm22-1 --release --install --prefix "/usr/local/"
  
  - Building with cranelift only (with installation)
    $ ./build.sh ---release --install --prefix "/usr/local/"

  - Building with LLVM 22.1 only (with installation)
    $ ./build.sh --with-llvm=llvm22-1 --enable-cranelift=OFF ---release --install --prefix "/usr/local/"
